{
  "id": "hook-card",
  "name": "Hook Card",
  "category": "Talking Head",
  "durationInFrames": 105,
  "layer": "overlay",
  "stillAt": 0.6,
  "description": "The opening title of a talking-head video, laid out around the speaker the project style's way: split with a torn or ruled seam, a taped photo, a terminal window or a rounded inset.",
  "useWhen": "The first 2–4 s of a talking-head or creator video, a section opener, a big promise. Layouts that frame the speaker (top, stack, collage, window, hud, frame, tv, inset) leave a hole: give the speaker's video clip this box for the hook's duration (split the clip at the hook's end). Mobile — top/stack: {x:0,y:split/100,width:1,height:1-split/100}; collage: {x:0.11,y:0.45,width:0.78,height:0.41}; window: {x:0.07,y:0.47,width:0.86,height:0.42}; hud: {x:0.06,y:0.45,width:0.88,height:0.45}; frame: {x:0.1,y:0.44,width:0.8,height:0.46}; tv: {x:0.13,y:0.45,width:0.74,height:0.34} with radius 44; inset: {x:0.08,y:0.47,width:0.84,height:0.43} with radius 36. Wide — top/stack: {x:split/100,y:0,width:1-split/100,height:1}; collage: {x:0.53,y:0.14,width:0.38,height:0.72}; window: {x:0.5,y:0.2,width:0.44,height:0.66}; hud: {x:0.5,y:0.14,width:0.44,height:0.72}; frame: {x:0.52,y:0.14,width:0.4,height:0.72}; tv: {x:0.53,y:0.16,width:0.36,height:0.56} with radius 44; inset: {x:0.52,y:0.12,width:0.4,height:0.76} with radius 36. \"full\" covers the frame; \"card\" floats over full-frame footage. Mark the accent with *stars*.",
  "tags": [
    "hook",
    "title",
    "talking head",
    "creator",
    "split",
    "intro"
  ],
  "props": {
